#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:3 ../../../source/refs/controllers.paperdiy.ref
msgid "PaperDIY"
msgstr "PaperDIY"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:7
msgid ""
"PaperDIY is an ESP32-S3 controller with a 4.7-inch, 960x540 monochrome e-paper "
"display, 16MB Flash, and 8MB PSRAM."
msgstr "PaperDIY 是一款基于 ESP32-S3 的主机，配备 4.7 英寸、960x540 单色墨水屏、16MB Flash 和 8MB PSRAM。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:9
msgid "Support the following products:"
msgstr "支持以下产品："

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:11
msgid "|PaperDIY|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:14
msgid "Supported Components"
msgstr "支持的组件"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:16
msgid "PaperDIY supports the following components:"
msgstr "PaperDIY 支持以下组件："

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:18
msgid "`Display <../hardware/display.html>`_: Screen drawing through ``M5.Lcd``."
msgstr "`Display <../hardware/display.html>`_：通过 ``M5.Lcd`` 进行屏幕绘图。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:19
msgid ""
"`Widgets <../widgets/index.html>`_: Labels and basic UI components through "
"``M5.Widgets`` and the ``widgets`` package."
msgstr "`Widgets <../widgets/index.html>`_：通过 ``M5.Widgets`` 和 ``widgets`` 包使用标签等基础 UI 组件。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:20
msgid "`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_: The ``unit`` package containing Unit drivers."
msgstr "`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_：包含 Unit 驱动的 ``unit`` 包。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:21
msgid "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_: The ``chain`` package for Chain devices."
msgstr "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_：用于 Chain 设备的 ``chain`` 包。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:22
msgid "``usb.device``: USB HID keyboard and mouse support."
msgstr "``usb.device``：提供 USB HID 键盘和鼠标支持。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:24
msgid ""
"The PaperDIY firmware uses M5GFX for display rendering. LVGL and M5UI are not enabled"
" in this firmware."
msgstr "PaperDIY 固件使用 M5GFX 进行显示渲染，未启用 LVGL 和 M5UI。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:27
msgid "Supported Display Fonts"
msgstr "支持的显示字体"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:29
msgid ""
"The PaperDIY firmware provides the following Montserrat fonts through "
"``M5.Lcd.FONTS`` and ``M5.Widgets.FONTS``: ``Montserrat12``, ``Montserrat14``, "
"``Montserrat16``, ``Montserrat18``, ``Montserrat24``, ``Montserrat40``, "
"``Montserrat44``, and ``Montserrat48``."
msgstr ""
"PaperDIY 固件通过 ``M5.Lcd.FONTS`` 和 ``M5.Widgets.FONTS`` 提供以下 Montserrat "
"字体：``Montserrat12``、``Montserrat14``、``Montserrat16``、``Montserrat18``、``Montserrat24``、``Montserrat40``、``Montserrat44``"
" 和 ``Montserrat48``。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:31
msgid ""
"The firmware also provides ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``, ``AlibabaSansJA24``, and "
"``AlibabaSansKR24`` for Chinese, Japanese, and Korean text respectively."
msgstr "固件还提供 ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``、``AlibabaSansJA24`` 和 ``AlibabaSansKR24``，分别用于显示中文、日文和韩文。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:34
msgid "Board Features"
msgstr "板载功能"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:36
msgid "PaperDIY supports the following built-in functions and peripherals:"
msgstr "PaperDIY 支持以下内置功能和外设："

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:38
msgid "A 4.7-inch monochrome e-paper display with portrait and landscape orientations."
msgstr "4.7 英寸单色墨水屏，支持竖屏和横屏显示。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:39
msgid "`Button <../hardware/button.html>`_ input through ``BtnA`` and ``BtnB``."
msgstr "通过 ``BtnA`` 和 ``BtnB`` 进行 `按键 <../hardware/button.html>`_ 输入。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:40
msgid ""
"`Power <../system/power.html>`_ monitoring through M5PM1: USB and battery voltages, "
"charging status, and battery-charging control."
msgstr "通过 M5PM1 进行 `电源管理 <../system/power.html>`_：读取 USB 电压、电池电压和充电状态，并控制电池充电。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:41
msgid "TF (microSD) card storage."
msgstr "TF（microSD）卡存储。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:42
msgid "Wi-Fi networking and native USB programming."
msgstr "Wi-Fi 联网和原生 USB 编程。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:44
msgid "The e-paper display has no touch panel or backlight."
msgstr "墨水屏不带触摸面板和背光。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:47
msgid "UiFlow2 Example"
msgstr "UiFlow2 示例"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:50 ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:83
msgid "Button Counter"
msgstr "按键计数"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:52
msgid "Open the |paperdiy_button_counter_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |paperdiy_button_counter_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:54 ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:85
msgid ""
"This example displays two independent button counters in portrait orientation. Press "
"**BtnA** or **BtnB** to increment its own counter. Both counters start at 0 when the "
"example starts."
msgstr "此示例以竖屏显示两个独立的按键计数器。按下 **BtnA** 或 **BtnB**，对应的计数器加 1。示例启动时，两个计数器均从 0 开始。"

