#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:65 ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:98
msgid "Charge Detection"
msgstr "充电检测"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:67
msgid "Open the |paperdiy_charge_detection_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |paperdiy_charge_detection_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:69 ../../../source/controllers/paperdiy.rst:100
msgid ""
"This example displays battery voltage and USB voltage in millivolts (mV), together "
"with charging status. Battery charging starts enabled. Press **BtnA** to enable or "
"disable it. The readings refresh every 15 seconds and immediately after a button "
"press."
msgstr ""
"此示例以毫伏（mV）显示电池电压和 USB 电压，并显示充电状态。示例启动时默认开启电池充电，按下 **BtnA** 可开启或关闭充电。读数每 15 "
"秒刷新一次，按键后也会立即刷新。"

